# This plugin is a published library with `openclaw` as a peerDependency.
# npm resolves and pins the peer (and its transitive CVEs) into any committed
# lockfile, which SCA scanners then flag against this repo. Libraries don't
# commit lockfiles — the host app owns dependency resolution. See .npmrc.
